# MODULE K — WORKING HOURS & LABOUR COMPLIANCE

Integrate with the existing attendance and shift engine.

Track configurable:

* Maximum working hours
* Daily limits
* Weekly limits
* Rest periods
* Break requirements
* Overtime limits
* Night-shift rules
* Weekly-off rules
* Holiday rules

Build compliance checks against actual attendance.

Examples:

Employee works beyond configured threshold.

System should detect:

COMPLIANCE_WARNING

or

COMPLIANCE_VIOLATION

depending on configuration.

