# MODULE L — OVERTIME COMPLIANCE

Integrate with existing overtime functionality.

Support:

* Overtime eligibility
* Maximum overtime
* Approval requirement
* Compensation rules
* Jurisdiction
* Worker category
* Effective date

Generate compliance alerts when configured limits are exceeded.

