# MODULE T — LEGAL DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT

Create a legal document repository.

Support:

* Employment agreements
* Offer letters
* Appointment letters
* Amendments
* Confidentiality agreements
* Policy documents
* Contractor agreements
* Compliance certificates
* Regulatory documents

Support:

* Document versioning
* Effective date
