# MODULE U — DOCUMENT EXPIRATION

Implement automated document expiry tracking.

Examples:

* Registration expiry
* Employee certification expiry
* Work permit expiry
* Contract expiry
* Insurance expiry
* Compliance certificate expiry

Generate alerts:

30 days before
15 days before
7 days before
1 day before
On expiry

These intervals should be configurable.

Use Celery/Redis if already available.

