# MODULE V — COMPLIANCE ALERT ENGINE

Create a centralized compliance alert engine.

Alert types:

* Registration expiring
* Document expiring
* Filing overdue
* Payroll compliance failure
* Minimum wage violation
* Overtime threshold violation
* Missing employee statutory information
* Missing acknowledgement
* Missing compliance evidence
* Policy expiration
* Audit finding
* Configuration conflict

Severity:

INFO
LOW
MEDIUM
HIGH
CRITICAL

Alerts should integrate with the existing notification system.

