# MODULE W — ESCALATION ENGINE

Implement configurable escalation.

Example:

Day 0:
Notify responsible person

Day 3:
Notify manager

Day 7:
Notify compliance administrator

Day 10:
Notify HR head

Day 15:
Notify tenant administrator

Do not hard-code these intervals.

Create configurable escalation policies.

