# MODULE AD — DATA PRIVACY MANAGEMENT

Create a generic privacy framework.

Support:

* Privacy policy version
* Consent records
* Data-processing purpose
* Consent timestamp
* Withdrawal
* Data access request
* Data correction request
* Data deletion request where legally applicable
* Data export request
* Retention policy

Do not assume one country's privacy law.

Create configurable jurisdiction-level privacy settings.

