# MODULE AE — CONSENT MANAGEMENT

Create:

consents

and

consent_versions

Support:

* Consent type
* Purpose
* Version
* Employee/user
* Granted at
* Withdrawn at
* Source
* IP address where appropriate
* User agent where appropriate

Consent history must be immutable.

