# MODULE AF — DATA SUBJECT REQUESTS

Create a workflow for employee/user data requests.

Types:

* DATA_ACCESS
* DATA_CORRECTION
* DATA_EXPORT
* DATA_DELETION
* CONSENT_WITHDRAWAL

Statuses:

SUBMITTED
UNDER_REVIEW
APPROVED
REJECTED
PROCESSING
COMPLETED

Support authorized HR/privacy administrators.

Sensitive operations must require elevated authorization.

---

# MODULE AG — DATA RETENTION ENGINE

Create configurable data-retention policies.

Configure retention by:

* Data category
* Jurisdiction
* Organization
* Employee type
* Record type
* Retention duration
* Legal hold

Examples:

Employee documents
Payroll records
Attendance records
Audit logs
Consent records
Compliance evidence

Do NOT automatically delete records merely because a retention period has passed.

Implement:

RETENTION_DUE

and require configured approval/legal basis before destructive deletion where appropriate.

---

# MODULE AH — LEGAL HOLD

Create legal hold functionality.

When legal hold is active:

* Prevent deletion
* Prevent destructive anonymization
* Preserve records
* Log access
* Track legal-hold owner
* Track reason
* Track start date
* Track release date

Legal holds must override normal retention deletion workflows.

---

# MODULE AI — RECORD LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT

Create generic lifecycle states:

ACTIVE
ARCHIVED
RETENTION_DUE
LEGAL_HOLD
PENDING_DELETION
DELETED
ANONYMIZED

The system must preserve auditability.

---

# MODULE AJ — ENTERPRISE ADMINISTRATION

Create an Enterprise Administration module.

Support:

* Organization settings
* Legal entities
* Establishments
* Compliance configuration
* Security settings
* Data-retention settings
* Notification policies
* Password policies
* Session policies
* API policies
* Integration settings
* Audit settings

Only authorized administrators should access these settings.

