# 33. OBSERVABILITY

Integrate with the existing logging/monitoring system.

Log:

* Compliance job failures
* Rule evaluation failures
* Payroll compliance failures
* Notification failures
* Export failures
* File-processing failures
* Privacy workflow failures

Never log:

* Passwords
* Tokens
* Full tax identifiers
* Full social-security identifiers
* Sensitive document contents

