# 45. DO NOT DO THESE THINGS

Do NOT:

* Rebuild authentication
* Rebuild employee management
* Duplicate payroll
* Duplicate attendance
* Duplicate leave
* Duplicate notifications
* Duplicate file storage
* Duplicate audit logging
* Hard-code country-specific laws into core logic
* Delete historical compliance rules
* Modify historical payroll silently
* Expose sensitive statutory identifiers
* Trust frontend tenant_id
* Trust frontend employee_id
* Bypass RBAC
* bypass approval workflows
* store secrets in source code
* log sensitive identifiers
* create unindexed large queries
* introduce N+1 queries
* delete data automatically without retention/legal-hold safeguards

