# 50. IMPORTANT IMPLEMENTATION PHILOSOPHY

Build this as a commercial SaaS product.

The system must be:

* Production-ready
* Secure
* Maintainable
* Scalable
* Multi-tenant
* Auditable
* Configurable
* Extensible
* Testable
* API-first
* Mobile-ready
* Cloud-ready

Do not implement superficial CRUD screens only.

Build proper domain services, authorization, workflows, database constraints, auditability, effective-dated configuration, background processing and automated tests.

Always prefer:

Reusable architecture
+
Strong domain modeling
+
Security
+
Data integrity
+
Testability
+
Observability

over quick implementation.

